            <note corresp="#d249-f5" n="5" xml:id="d249-f5-content">
                <p>
                    Bunker reported on his meeting with
                        Minh in telegram 13418 from Saigon, August 20. He
                    pressed Minh to reconsider withdrawing because of the
                    destabilizing effects it could have on the country and U.S. public support,
                    adding that he had asked Tran Van Linh, Chief Justice of South Vietnam’s Supreme
                    Court, to delay a decision on Ky’s appeal
                    until August 23 so that he, Bunker, could
                    convince Ky to stay in the race.
                    (National Archives, Nixon Presidential
                    Materials, NSC Files, Box 872, For the
                    President’s Files, Lord, China Trip,
                    Vietnam, Vietnam Elections)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
